! RFC 2119 — Key Words for Use in RFCs to Indicate Requirement Levels

A reference meme. It carries RFC 2119's own bibliographic facts — fetched from rfc-editor.org,
never invented — in `[reference]` above, so a pin at this address cites the work itself.

